      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "search-input",
      "description": "可見用途標籤與目錄搜尋。",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-search-label\" for=\"ds-search\">搜尋操作、設定、模型與原碼</label><input class=\"ds-search\" id=\"ds-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"輸入關鍵字\">",
      "css": ".ds-search-label{font-family:system-ui, \"Microsoft JhengHei\", sans-serif;display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px}.ds-search{font-family:system-ui, \"Microsoft JhengHei\", sans-serif;width:100%;color:var(--ink);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 36px 10px 12px;caret-color:var(--accent)}.ds-search::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}.ds-search:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "目錄選項",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-active",
      "description": "底色、字重及主色共同表示目前流程。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"地圖目錄\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item\">程式目錄</button><button class=\"ds-nav-item ds-active\" aria-current=\"true\">目前流程</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{background:var(--nav);padding:8px}.ds-nav-item{font-family:system-ui, \"Microsoft JhengHei\", sans-serif;display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;color:var(--ink);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:14px;padding:10px 12px;margin:4px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav-item.ds-active{background:var(--wash);color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}.ds-nav-item:hover,.ds-nav-item:active{background:var(--wash);color:var(--accent)}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "流程節點",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "flow-node",
      "description": "固定尺寸的步驟、層級、標題與摘要。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-node\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-meta\"><span class=\"ds-step\">1</span><span class=\"ds-layer\">瀏覽器</span></span><span class=\"ds-title\">畫面接收操作</span><span class=\"ds-text\">整理欄位與身份，交給下一層處理。</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-node{font-family:system-ui, \"Microsoft JhengHei\", sans-serif;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;width:276px;height:196px;padding:16px;text-align:left;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;cursor:pointer}.ds-node:hover{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--paper)}.ds-node[aria-pressed=true]{border:2px solid var(--accent);padding:15px;background:var(--wash)}.ds-node:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}.ds-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.7}.ds-step{display:grid;place-items:center;min-width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--ground);color:var(--ink);font-size:12px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-layer{color:var(--accent)}.ds-title{font-size:17px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.5;display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:anywhere;flex-shrink:0}.ds-text{font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--muted);display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:3;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-node{transition:border-color .15s,background-color .15s}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "浮動解說",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "floating-inspector",
      "description": "完整內容有獨立捲動區與底部逐步控制。",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-inspector\" aria-label=\"卡片解說\"><header class=\"ds-head\"><span>目前流程 · 步驟 1</span><button class=\"ds-close\" aria-label=\"關閉卡片解說\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 6 12 12M18 6 6 18\"/></svg></button></header><div class=\"ds-content\"><h2>畫面接收操作</h2><p>摘要以外的完整解說在面板內閱讀。</p></div><footer class=\"ds-steps\"><button disabled>上一步</button><output>1 / 5</output><button>下一步</button></footer></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-inspector{font-family:system-ui, \"Microsoft JhengHei\", sans-serif;width:380px;max-width:100%;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);border-radius:24px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);overflow:hidden}.ds-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;padding:12px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;line-height:1.7}.ds-inspector button{font-family:system-ui, \"Microsoft JhengHei\", sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:8px 12px;cursor:pointer}.ds-inspector button:hover:not(:disabled),.ds-inspector button:active:not(:disabled){background:var(--wash);color:var(--accent)}.ds-inspector button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}.ds-inspector button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}.ds-inspector .ds-close{width:36px;height:36px;padding:0;display:grid;place-items:center}.ds-close svg{width:17px;height:17px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round}.ds-content{padding:24px;overflow:auto}.ds-content h2{margin:0;font-size:22px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.55}.ds-content p{margin:16px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85}.ds-steps{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.ds-steps button{font-size:12px;min-height:40px}.ds-steps output{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "原碼來源",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "source-link",
      "description": "可換行的內嵌原碼定位。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-source\">tools/project-map/map.js:1</button>",
      "css": ".ds-source{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--accent);background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:14px;padding:8px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere;cursor:pointer}.ds-source:hover,.ds-source:active{background:var(--wash);color:var(--accent)}.ds-source:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "可追蹤的程式閱讀桌",
    "overview": "以「可追蹤的程式閱讀桌」組織維護資訊：目錄找內容，畫布讀相鄰步驟，浮動解說承載完整文字。層級清楚、文字好讀、流程容易追蹤，是這份工具的方向。\n\n此系統只適用 tools/project-map。亮暗色共享語意與操作，使用系統繁體中文字型及純 DOM／SVG，保持單檔離線閱讀。產品 App 的字型、導覽與版面另由根目錄文件規範。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "目錄、流程與解說分工清楚。",
      "選取、目前連線與來源使用產品主色。",
      "桌面向右閱讀，手機向下閱讀。",
      "鍵盤焦點與減少動態保留相同操作。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The 層級辨識 Rule",
        "body": "主色表示選取、目前連線、焦點與來源；程式層級另有語意色，並保留文字名稱。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The 完整閱讀 Rule",
        "body": "卡片顯示摘要，選取後在解說取得完整文字；摘要截斷不取代完整內容。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The 浮動解說 Rule",
        "body": "解說覆蓋畫布，不改變畫布尺寸；逐步操作保留在面板內。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 依 map.css、map.js 與 template.html 維護本工具，修改後重新產生 HTML。",
      "Do 同時維護亮暗色語意、可見焦點與減少動態支援。",
      "Do 保留文字層級、完整解說及可換行的來源路徑。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 為離線工具增加外部字型、CDN 或產品 runtime。",
      "Don't 把這份局部系統延伸成產品 App 的全站規則。"
    ]
  }
